{"unit_id":"tag:06GE:proof","translation":"令<MATH_0001>为<MATH_0002>的核（kernel）。极大理想（maximal ideal）<MATH_0003>是幂零（nilpotent）的，因为<MATH_0004>是阿廷（Artinian）的，设<MATH_0005>。于是得到分解（factorization）<MATH_0006>，将<MATH_0007>分解为满射（surjective）映射（maps）的复合（composition），其核（kernels）被极大理想（maximal ideal）消去。因此，只需在<MATH_0008>本身是这样的映射（map）时证明引理，即<SPACE_0001><MATH_0009>被<MATH_0010>消去的情形。此时<MATH_0011>是一个<MATH_0012>向量空间（vector space），其维数（dimension）有限（finite），见代数（Algebra），引理<REF_0001>。取基（basis）<MATH_0013>，属于作为<MATH_0015>向量空间（vector space）的<MATH_0014>，得到分解（factorization）<MATH_0016>，将<MATH_0017>分解为小扩张（small extensions）的复合（composition）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"kernel","target_term":"核"},{"source_term":"maximal ideal","target_term":"极大理想"},{"source_term":"nilpotent","target_term":"幂零"},{"source_term":"Artinian","target_term":"阿廷"},{"source_term":"factorization","target_term":"分解"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"kernels","target_term":"核"},{"source_term":"maximal ideal","target_term":"极大理想"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"vector space","target_term":"向量空间"},{"source_term":"dimension","target_term":"维数"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"basis","target_term":"基"},{"source_term":"vector space","target_term":"向量空间"},{"source_term":"factorization","target_term":"分解"},{"source_term":"small extensions","target_term":"小扩张"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"kernel","target_term":"核","context":"映射的核。"},{"source_term":"maximal ideal","target_term":"极大理想","context":"局部环的极大理想；完整词形待接受。"},{"source_term":"nilpotent","target_term":"幂零","context":"阿廷局部环的理想性质。"},{"source_term":"Artinian","target_term":"阿廷","context":"环的有限性性质。"},{"source_term":"factorization","target_term":"分解","context":"所构造的映射分解。"},{"source_term":"