{"unit_id":"tag:06GG:proof","translation":"若<MATH_0001>是单（simple）的<MATH_0002>模（module），则<MATH_0003>，作为<MATH_0004>模（module），见代数（Algebra），引理<REF_0001>。此时<MATH_0005>，且<MATH_0006>，见代数（Algebra），引理<REF_0002>。若<MATH_0007>有限（finite），则选择<MATH_0008>的一个由<MATH_0009>子模（submodules）组成且商（quotients）为单（simple）模的滤过（filtration），并使用可加性（additivity），即得结论，见代数（Algebra），引理<REF_0003>。若<MATH_0010>无限（infinite），结论来自显然的不等式（inequality）<MATH_0011>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"simple","target_term":"单"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"submodules","target_term":"子模"},{"source_term":"quotients","target_term":"商"},{"source_term":"simple","target_term":"单"},{"source_term":"filtration","target_term":"滤过"},{"source_term":"additivity","target_term":"可加性"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"infinite","target_term":"无限"},{"source_term":"inequality","target_term":"不等式"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"simple","target_term":"单","context":"模及滤过商的单性。"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"给定的模。"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数","context":"所引章节。"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"模的长度有限。"},{"source_term":"submodules","target_term":"子模","context":"长度滤过的子模。"},{"source_term":"quotients","target_term":"商","context":"滤过的单商。"},{"source_term":"filtration","target_term":"滤过","context":"用于长度计算的滤过。"},{"source_term":"additivity","target_term":"可加性","context":"长度的可加性。"},{"source_term":"infinite","target_term":"无限","context":"模的长度无限。"},{"source_term":"inequality","target_term":"不等式","context":"两种长度的比较。"}],"notes":["remark：证明中的受保护公式写 [k' : k]，与陈述及前文 [k : k'] 的方向存在疑点；保留锁定原式，不替原文勘误。"]}
